1. Changes to this branch can only be made after review by 2 out of 3 people. Meaning, if someone proposes a change, one more of us needs to check that code.
Apart from this, everyone will have their own copy of this drive folder to begin with. Anyone can make any changes to their own copy to experiment.
2. Everyday, we'll store only those files in a new folder for that day, for which some changes have been done.
3. There will be another file or excel sheet stating when each file was last changed, alongwith its date of creation. This is important to keep track of versions.
4. Each time a change is suggested to a file, the matlab file should start with a comment paragraph stating, in brief, what changes were made to it as compared to the last time.